      "id": "atlassian-rovo-dev--summary",
      "approach_id": "atlassian-rovo-dev",
      "field": "summary",
      "text": "Atlassian's internal coding agent, built on the HULA (Human-in-the-loop software development agents) framework. Rovo Dev works inside Jira and runs a four-step cycle (set context, generate a plan, generate code, and raise a pull request). Atlassian dogfooded it across all Jira sites for more than a year across 1,900+ repositories. It reached general availability in October 2025.",
      "kind": "fact",
      "provenance": "reported",
      "confidence": "high",
      "confidence_reason": "A linked first-party source states the claim.",
